    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one thing though—in some of the meetings i've been in, it feels like a lot of these \"concerns\" are just people being NIMBYs or trying to block progress because they don't want change. how much of this is actually legitimate planning stuff vs just people being difficult?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
